Error [E1102]: `cfg` can't be sent because `Config` isn't sendable
  --> tests/ui/unsendable_send.jet:13:18
    |
 13 |     sender.send(^cfg)
    |                  ^^^
 Why: `Config` contains `logger`, which holds a `ref` field at `logger.sink`; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: send plain owned data instead, or rebuild the value without shared-view fields before calling `.send()`
